<VI _name="lvdqmh_duplicate_event_dqmh7.vi" description="Headless DQMH Duplicate Event\2C DQMH 7.x. Copies ONE event of a DQMH module in the ACTIVE project - into the same module or into another one - under a new name\2C by calling Delacor's own scripting VIs as STATIC subVIs\3A the chain Delacor's Event\5CDuplicate DQMH Event.vi runs behind its dialog\2C with no dialog and no keystroke.\0A\0AChain\3A Parse Project for DQMH Modules.vi -> source and destination module by NAME (an empty Destination Module Name means the source) -> Get All Events in Module.vi on the source with Delacor's ring strings (type prefix included) -> Correct Round Trip Events in List.vi\2C as the dialog does\2C so Event Index indexes the SAME list the dialog's ring shows -> Duplicate Event.vi -> lvdqmh_close_modules_dqmh7.vi on the modules Duplicate Event.vi did not close itself.\0A\0ADRY RUN BY DEFAULT. Script? FALSE parses and lists Event Ring Strings and Event Names\3B the caller picks Event Index from them. Scripting also needs both modules found\2C Event Index inside the list\2C no locked module and no error.\0A\0ADELACOR'S DEFAULTS. Consuming Event Loop is Event Handling Loop\2C the value the dialog offers for a public request. An empty Event Description copies the source event's own description (Get VI.Description)\2C as the dialog pre-fills it - cut at Delacor's _____ footer\2C which Script New Event.vi appends again (measured\3A copied whole\2C the footer came out twice).\0A\0ANO MODAL DIALOG ON PURPOSE. The dialog checks the new names with Verify Event Names.vi\2C which answers a failure with a modal\3B the caller makes those checks before Script? is TRUE. Duplicate Event.vi calls Script New Event.vi\2C which reports a scripting error through Simple Error Handler's modal.\0A\0ARequires DQMH 7.x and a project OPEN AND ACTIVE in the IDE\2C and lvdqmh_close_modules_dqmh7.vi composed or loaded. Generated by LabVIEWMCP\3B the Delacor VIs it calls belong to the user's DQMH installation and are not shipped with it.">
